---
/**
 * Ambient data streams: thin Operational Green strokes that draw down the
 * monospace character grid behind the whole page, with a caret-like head that
 * steps row by row, plus occasional horizontal scan strokes along a text row.
 * A very faint field of grid ticks keeps empty space textured between streams.
 *
 * Purely decorative and hidden from assistive technology. It sits behind every
 * section, so the canvas is masked down over the 56rem reading column and
 * keeps full strength only in the margins. Heads stay well below functional
 * green so the hero caret remains the brightest signal on screen.
 *
 * Capped at 30fps, paused in background tabs, and under reduced motion it
 * draws only the static ticks and a few frozen strokes. Without JavaScript it
 * renders nothing.
 */
---

<canvas class="data-streams" aria-hidden="true" data-data-streams></canvas>

<style is:global>
  .data-streams {
    --stream-column: 28rem;
    --stream-dim: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 1200ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    /* Full strength in the margins, dimmed over the reading column so
       headings and copy that sit on the canvas stay easy to read. */
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      #000 0,
      #000 calc(50% - var(--stream-column) - 3rem),
      var(--stream-dim) calc(50% - var(--stream-column) + 2rem),
      var(--stream-dim) calc(50% + var(--stream-column) - 2rem),
      #000 calc(50% + var(--stream-column) + 3rem),
      #000 100%
    );
  }

  .data-streams[data-ready] {
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
